<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Architecture</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>document<sp/>describes<sp/>the<sp/>runtime<sp/>architecture<sp/>of<sp/>Project<sp/>Valhalla<sp/>as<sp/>it<sp/>is</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">implemented<sp/>in<sp/>`src/`.<sp/>It<sp/>is<sp/>complementary<sp/>to<sp/>`README.md`,<sp/>which<sp/>focuses<sp/>on</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">installation,<sp/>configuration<sp/>and<sp/>API<sp/>usage.<sp/>For<sp/>generated<sp/>API<sp/>reference</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">documentation,<sp/>run<sp/>`doxygen<sp/>Doxyfile`<sp/>and<sp/>open</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`build/docs/doxygen/html/index.html`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>1.<sp/>System<sp/>purpose</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Valhalla<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>C++20<sp/>REST<sp/>service<sp/>for<sp/>healthcare<sp/>scheduling.<sp/>It<sp/>exposes<sp/>a<sp/>JSON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">HTTP<sp/>API<sp/>under<sp/>`/api/v2`<sp/>for<sp/>managing<sp/>clients<sp/>(users<sp/>and<sp/>providers),<sp/>services</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">(clinics,<sp/>pharmacies,<sp/>laboratories,<sp/>radiology<sp/>centres),<sp/>staff,<sp/>appointments<sp/>and</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">clinical<sp/>records.<sp/>Requests<sp/>are<sp/>authenticated<sp/>with<sp/>JWT<sp/>bearer<sp/>tokens<sp/>and</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">authorised<sp/>against<sp/>a<sp/>per-entity<sp/>permission<sp/>model;<sp/>data<sp/>is<sp/>persisted<sp/>in</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">PostgreSQL<sp/>through<sp/>Drogon.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>2.<sp/>Technology<sp/>stack</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**HTTP<sp/>framework:**<sp/>Drogon<sp/>(event<sp/>loops,<sp/>routing,<sp/>filters/advice,<sp/>coroutines).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Database:**<sp/>PostgreSQL,<sp/>accessed<sp/>either<sp/>synchronously<sp/>through<sp/>`libpqxx`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>with<sp/>a<sp/>custom<sp/>connection<sp/>pool,<sp/>or<sp/>asynchronously<sp/>through<sp/>Drogon&apos;s<sp/>`DbClient`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>(`DB_ASYNC=true`).</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Support<sp/>libraries:**<sp/>`fmt`<sp/>(formatting),<sp/>`jsoncons`<sp/>(JSON),<sp/>`jwt-cpp`</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>(tokens),<sp/>`libsodium`/`cppcodec`<sp/>(password<sp/>hashing),<sp/>`xxHash`<sp/>(fingerprints),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>`spdlog`/Trantor<sp/>(logging),<sp/>cURL,<sp/>ZLIB,<sp/>c-ares.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>**Build:**<sp/>CMake<sp/>+<sp/>Conan,<sp/>Catch2<sp/>for<sp/>tests.<sp/>Dependency<sp/>versions<sp/>are<sp/>pinned<sp/>in</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>`conan.lock`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>3.<sp/>Component<sp/>map</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```mermaid</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">flowchart<sp/>TD</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Client[HTTP<sp/>client]<sp/>--&gt;|TCP|<sp/>Drogon[Drogon<sp/>event<sp/>loops\nServer::run]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Drogon<sp/>--&gt;|pre-routing<sp/>advice|<sp/>Method[Method<sp/>/<sp/>OPTIONS<sp/>gate\nCors<sp/>+<sp/>isConventionalMethod]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Method<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>Filters[Filters\nAuth<sp/>·<sp/>RateLimit<sp/>·<sp/>ElapsedTime]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Filters<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>Routes[api/v2<sp/>routes\nclients<sp/>·<sp/>services<sp/>·<sp/>staff<sp/>·<sp/>appointments<sp/>·<sp/>clinic]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Routes<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>GK[GateKeeper\nlogin/logout<sp/>·<sp/>permissions<sp/>·<sp/>DoS]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Routes<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>Ctrl[Controllers\nEntityControllerBase<sp/>+<sp/>specialisations]</highlight></codeline>
