<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>GK<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>SM[SessionManager]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>GK<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>TM[TokenManager]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>GK<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>PW[PasswordWorker]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>GK<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>DD[DOSDetector]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Ctrl<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>Val[Validator<sp/>+<sp/>DatabaseSchema]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Ctrl<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>Ent[Entities\nCRUDS<sp/>SQL<sp/>builders]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Ent<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>DB{Layer}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>DB<sp/>--&gt;|sync|<sp/>Pool[DatabaseConnectionPool<sp/>→<sp/>Database<sp/>→<sp/>DatabaseHandler<sp/>→<sp/>DbExecutor]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>DB<sp/>--&gt;|async|<sp/>ACD[AsyncDbClient<sp/>→<sp/>AsyncSqlBinder<sp/>→<sp/>AsyncResultMapper]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Pool<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>PG[(PostgreSQL)]</highlight></codeline>
